{
  "description": "Golden parity for recruitmentAnalytics.getLostByDelay: the PURE buildLostByDelayView(rejected) in @tims/shared. Asserted by the REAL TS export (tests/reporting/lost-by-delay-view-fixtures.test.ts) and C# LostByDelayViewBuilder. Pins: grouped by stage NAME (first-seen SLA kept even if a later same-name row differs), only rejections STRICTLY over SLA (== not counted), null sla / null rejectedAt skipped; slaDays + avgDaysOver round half-up; items sort by lostCount DESCENDING (stable, insertion order on ties). Timestamps epoch-ms (day = 86400000).",
